claim.claim-text:
a plurality of speakers located in a reproduction space;
signal generator that generates a sound signal corresponding to a virtual sound source representing a reflected sound in a target acoustic space; and
output portion that outputs the sound signal to the plurality of speakers, wherein the output portion:

obtains positions of a plurality of speakers located in a reproduction space;
receives a setting of acoustic parameters in the reproduction space;
sets acoustic parameters of each of the plurality of speakers based on the positions of the plurality of speakers and the setting of acoustic parameters; and
processes a signal processing to the sound signal to be output to the plurality of speakers based on the acoustic parameters of each of the plurality of speakers.
